  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Elias places a hand on his brow and practices a slow smile. Logos’s wings tremble. I place a “non-separation pact” between them and hand over homework for the next week. Far off, the reason that justifies loneliness creaks.",
    "ja": "Kaedeの声が通信に入る。彼女の声には、心配が混じっている。"
